    <td style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">Each
    of our non-employee directors received a portion of their fees in Class A Common Stock in lieu of cash. The amount each of our non-employee
