    60 days of the Record Date. It does not include 9,229,701 shares underlying warrants the exercise of which is subject to stockholder
    approval. The warrants are subject to a beneficial ownership limitation of 9.99%, which such limitation restricts the stockholder
    from exercising that portion of the warrants that would result in the stockholder and its affiliates owning, after exercise, a number
    of shares of Common Stock in excess of the beneficial ownership limitation. The address of Armistice Capital Master Fund Ltd.
